          title: "*The* teacher of Israel",
          body: "The Greek has the article: not “a teacher” but **the teacher of Israel** — a recognised master of the nation’s Scriptures. That is the sting. The very things Jesus says (new birth, water and Spirit, the wind of God) are woven through the Prophets Nicodemus has taught for years. He should have recognised them; the failure is not lack of information but a mind that has never been born from above.",
